Z||000005||MinnGreenGT||12-08-2001||09:09 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by cadaver:<BR><B>You do know that the glass ones will fit all the years, right?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><B>BUT</B> they are a slightly different size.  The glass ones are a touch smaller than the plexi pieces... they can be fitted to the car- you just want to be a little more careful in positioning. Especially if you had the car repainted with the larger plastic ones on (just taped off)- you may see a paint line.<P>------------------<BR>              <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/GreenGT6.gif"> ||||reg||1
